# Heavy generated working dirs under images/ that no shipped page links to.
# Keep images/{bundles,covers,mockups} — those ARE referenced.
images/peek/
images/pdf-ready/
images/kdp-ready-covers/

# T12: assets explicitly dropped from the staging image (wall-art preview).
# Matches .gitignore so the image stays lean even if a dev has the files
# locally outside git tracking.
#  - images/generated/: book-promo videos + coloring-book gen output
#  - non-4x5 print crops + full-res masters: only *-4x5.png and cover.png
#    are rendered by shipped pages; full-res prints are the product (stored
#    separately, delivered on order) and the PDF packager is gated behind
#    the Whop webhook which staging does not have
images/generated/
images/bundles/*/prints/*-2x3.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-3x4.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-iso.png
images/bundles/*/prints/*-master.png
# Coloring books/ and videos/ — their COPY lines are removed from the
# Dockerfile, but listed here for safety if anyone reintroduces a glob COPY.
Coloring books/
videos/

# Root-level dev docs.
MORNING-BRIEF.md
README.md
FORGE_PLAN.md

# Coolify / Hetzner / IDE noise.
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp

# Forge plan + memory.
FORGE_PLAN.md
server/FORGE_PLAN.md
